ize: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d46eedb9a0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d46eedb9a0.jpg"> </div><p>西班牙击败阿根廷夺得世界杯冠军，获得队史第二个世界杯冠军！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-20/6a5bd01b13b5anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">斗牛士王朝2.0！德拉富恩特率西班牙包揽24欧洲杯、26世界杯冠军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5bd069dbfd4.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5bd069dbfd4.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5bd069dbfd4.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯决赛，西班牙击败阿根廷，时隔16年再次捧起世界杯冠军！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-20/6a5d47220ba23native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">年少有为！亚马尔刚过19岁生日，已经包揽欧洲杯+世界杯大赛冠军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.59" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d4a4364515.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d4a4364515.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d4a4364515.jpg"> </div><p>西班牙战胜阿根廷夺冠，19岁马尔年生涯中已经获得了欧洲杯+世界杯两个重要的大赛冠军。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-20/6a5d4bec8a15enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">加时破门制胜！官方：费兰·托雷斯当选世界杯决赛全场最佳球员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/202607200633164236_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/202607200633164236_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/202607200633164236_720.jpg"> </div><p>西班牙加时1-0阿根廷夺冠。赛后FIFA官方宣布，费兰·托雷斯当选本场比赛全场最佳球员。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-20/6a5d50a35b6f3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">荣耀时刻！西班牙加冕2026世界杯冠军，队长罗德里带队捧起奖杯！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d559909a1a_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; wi