100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.79" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.79" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/202607200634216875.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/202607200634216875.jpg"> </div><p>2026美加墨世界杯落幕，冠军球队西班牙的中场核心罗德里荣膺世界杯金球奖！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-20/6a5ca66e6fe73native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">连续0丢球时长创纪录！官方：乌奈·西蒙获美加墨世界杯金手套奖</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.87" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/202607200634074497.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.87" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.87" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/202607200634074497.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/202607200634074497.jpg"> </div><p>2026美加墨世界杯结束，西班牙夺得世界杯冠军，乌奈·西蒙荣膺赛事最佳门将金手套奖！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-20/6a5d5090999c4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">主力身份随队夺冠！官方：19岁库巴西荣膺世界杯最佳年轻球员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.87" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/202607200633539307.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="backgrou